{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>coming up after them from the Nile.</b> This means in the manner we have written, that their entire existence was from the Nile. And although it does not say ״מִן הַיְאוֹר עוֹלוֹת״ as it said regarding the first ones, it relies on the word ״אַחֲרֵיהֶן״ — which follows the same order as the first, that from the Nile is the beginning of their coming into being."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:22.427066383Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}